    "notes": "Faceted low poly grey white rhinoceros standing with lowered head, large front horn and smaller rear horn. Intentional low-poly style: glTF validation clean (0 errors), faceted flat-shaded mesh at ~3k triangles with a single texture. Grab3D ships these as 'Lightweight' companions to the high-detail animals. Scoring reflects the deliberate low-poly aesthetic: clean silhouette and complete animal, but flat-shaded materials and minimal topology rather than PBR.",
